From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:46:13 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] quant: preserve affine codes in Q4_K to Q4_1 conversion

Transplant the existing 32-value integer grids and round only their affine coefficients to f16. Keep the ordinary quantizer when calibration is supplied or a coefficient cannot be represented. This format conversion is independent of the model-loading adjustments in patch 0003.
---
